WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:09.154
The next morning, when Ally got to work, Randy and Flo were standing behind the counter speaking in low voices.

2
00:00:09.155 --> 00:00:12.762
"Good morning," Ally said cheerfully.

3
00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:15.275
"Oh, hi," Randy said.

4
00:00:15.276 --> 00:00:22.680
But Flo barely greeted Ally before they both went back to work.

5
00:00:22.681 --> 00:00:26.319
"That's odd," Ally thought, tying on her apron.

6
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.552
"Are they mad at me? But why?

7
00:00:29.553 --> 00:00:35.429
Oh! Maybe Flo's upset that Ray went on vacation without her."

8
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.372
But that didn't feel right either.

9
00:00:37.373 --> 00:00:40.334
Flo and Ray hadn't been dating that long.

10
00:00:40.335 --> 00:00:42.469
Then it hit her.

11
00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:47.843
"Flo is probably upset that Dawn is back," Ally thought.

12
00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:52.350
Just then Jerry and Sally walked into the diner.

13
00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:55.843
"Barry asked us to meet him here," Jerry said.

14
00:00:55.844 --> 00:00:59.137
"While we wait, we'd like to shoot some footage of the diner."

15
00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:03.770
"No problem," Ally said. "Just don't film Flo."

16
00:01:03.771 --> 00:01:06.222
Soon Barry arrived, grinning.

17
00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:08.420
"I came up with a new dish.

18
00:01:08.421 --> 00:01:12.160
It's guaranteed to be something no one else will have."

19
00:01:12.161 --> 00:01:16.860
"You mean like Gorphelian Glug?" Ally asked.

20
00:01:16.861 --> 00:01:20.144
Everyone gave Ally a strange look.

21
00:01:20.145 --> 00:01:22.174
"Tee-hee!" Ally blushed.

22
00:01:22.175 --> 00:01:26.786
"Just kidding. What's your idea, Barry?"

23
00:01:26.787 --> 00:01:30.339
"Crater Cakes!" Barry said proudly.

24
00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:34.085
"What are those?" Randy asked.

25
00:01:34.086 --> 00:01:37.494
"Peanut butter and marshmallow hand pies. I

26
00:01:37.495 --> 00:01:41.215
bet everyone else will be making main course dishes. While

27
00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:45.350
Rolling Ray's is the only one serving dessert!" "That's

28
00:01:45.351 --> 00:01:48.580
a cool idea," Ally said. "I'm

29
00:01:48.581 --> 00:01:51.996
going to the truck to make a test batch," Barry said. "Mind

30
00:01:51.997 --> 00:01:56.484
if we come along?" Jerry asked. "We'd like to film you." "Sure!"

31
00:01:56.485 --> 00:02:05.262
Barry said. "Let's go!" ***

32
00:02:05.263 --> 00:02:09.699
At work, Ally didn't get a chance to ask Flo if something was wrong.

33
00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:14.533
As she walked into her room later, she told herself that she would try again soon.

34
00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:18.606
For now, she had to get ready for tonight's double date.

35
00:02:18.607 --> 00:02:23.089
"Should I wear my hair in a ponytail or down?" Ally asked Alpha.

36
00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:28.169
"Hair is for humans, not Astralians," Alpha said.

37
00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:31.778
"I know, but I like having it."

38
00:02:31.779 --> 00:02:35.859
Ally started brushing her hair when a thought stopped her.

39
00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:41.713
"What if, once he gets to know me, Julius decides he doesn't like me?"

40
00:02:41.714 --> 00:02:46.432
Alpha lit up. "That is in the realm of possibility."

41
00:02:46.433 --> 00:02:51.347
"Alpha!" Ally said. "You're supposed to be nice to me."

42
00:02:51.348 --> 00:02:55.862
"Nice does not compute. Truth does," Alpha said.

43
00:02:55.863 --> 00:03:03.237
"Ugh!" Ally changed her clothes and tugged at her new outfit.

44
00:03:03.238 --> 00:03:06.814
"You're not really helping me with my nervousness."

45
00:03:06.815 --> 00:03:10.659
"Nervousness is an irrational response!" Alpha snapped.

46
00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.904
Ally frowned. "You know what?

47
00:03:12.905 --> 00:03:15.836
I think I'll leave you home tonight to charge up."

48
00:03:15.837 --> 00:03:19.330
Before Alpha could reply, Mateo knocked on the door.

49
00:03:19.331 --> 00:03:22.490
"Are you ready to head to the park, Ally?" he called.

50
00:03:22.491 --> 00:03:26.355
"Julius and Bethany are meeting us there with some picnic food."

51
00:03:26.356 --> 00:03:28.565
"Yes," Ally called back.

52
00:03:28.566 --> 00:03:38.162
"I'll be ready as soon as I power down Alpha. She's acting glitchy again!"

53
00:03:38.163 --> 00:03:44.822
*** On the way to the park, Mateo's phone

54
00:03:44.823 --> 00:03:46.799
pinged. He had a text from

55
00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:52.906
Barry: I spent three hours developing the recipe for the hand pies. They turned out

56
00:03:52.907 --> 00:03:55.367
fantastic! "That's great," Ally

57
00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:59.271
said. "It is!" Mateo said as he scrolled

58
00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:03.876
down. "Or maybe not. Look at

59
00:04:03.877 --> 00:04:09.446
this." But then Jerry told me that the Food Dude announced they're serving chocolate-filled hand

60
00:04:09.447 --> 00:04:11.894
pies! "Ugh," Ally

61
00:04:11.895 --> 00:04:18.457
groaned. "That's the second time another team came up with a dish that's just like

62
00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:20.748
ours." She halted and looked at

63
00:04:20.749 --> 00:04:24.998
Mateo. "Is it me, or does that seem really

64
00:04:24.999 --> 00:04:28.646
strange? It can't be just a coincidence, can

65
00:04:28.647 --> 00:04:32.919
it?" "I was thinking the same thing," Mateo said with a frown.

66
00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:36.385
"Something fishy is going on around here."

67
00:04:36.386 --> 00:04:39.574
"And chocolaty!" Ally said.

68
00:04:39.575 --> 00:04:43.895
"I think there's a mole," Mateo said.

69
00:04:43.896 --> 00:04:47.405
"What do moles have to do with this?" Ally asked.

70
00:04:47.406 --> 00:04:50.016
"Don't they live underground?"

71
00:04:50.017 --> 00:04:54.080
"Not that kind of a mole," Mateo said.

72
00:04:54.081 --> 00:04:56.767
"I mean a mole, like a spy.

73
00:04:56.768 --> 00:05:00.344
Maybe someone is feeding information to the other teams."

74
00:05:00.345 --> 00:05:06.540
Ally gasped. "I can't believe anyone would do that!"

75
00:05:06.541 --> 00:05:11.178
"Me neither, but it's the only explanation," Mateo said.

76
00:05:11.179 --> 00:05:12.535
Ally nodded.

77
00:05:12.536 --> 00:05:18.821
"We've got to figure out who it is, or we'll lose the contest before it even begins.

78
00:05:18.822 --> 00:05:23.935
But how do you catch a spy? We don't have them on Astralia."

79
00:05:23.936 --> 00:05:29.700
"I guess it's hard to keep secrets when everyone can read minds," Mateo said.

80
00:05:29.701 --> 00:05:32.076
"That's it!" Ally cried.

81
00:05:32.077 --> 00:05:36.719
"I'll read everyone's minds to find out who's spying on us!"

82
00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:44.898
"Everyone?" Mateo gestured to the people who were pouring into the park to watch the eclipse.

83
00:05:44.899 --> 00:05:50.045
"If that's what it takes," Ally said firmly, "that's what I'll do!

84
00:05:50.046 --> 00:05:52.625
And I'm going to start right now.

85
00:05:52.626 --> 00:05:57.899
Any one of these people here in Sandville could be the spy!"

